flowchart LR
    H[Hypothesis] --> X[Expose a small slice]
    X --> O[Observe SLIs vs control]
    O --> D{Within bounds?}
    D -->|yes| W[Widen or keep]
    D -->|no| R[Withdraw immediately]
    W --> L[Learn]
    R --> L
    L --> H

    style H fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#1565c0
    style X fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
    style O fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#1565c0
    style D fill:#ffe0b2,stroke:#ef6c00
    style R fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style W fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style L fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
